OL,3,GNEWSAResidents oppose football club's
OL,4,Apublic field fence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football club's plans to restrict
OL,7,Faccess to its field has prompted
OL,8,Fhundreds of objections.
OL,10,FLast year, Skelton United Football
OL,11,FClub, in east Cleveland, placed a fence
OL,12,Faround the field used by its players
OL,13,Fand currently have an application in
OL,14,Fwith Redcar and Cleveland Council to
OL,15,Flock two of the three access points at
OL,16,Fall times, except for emergency
OL,17,Fservices.
OL,19,FThe field is leased to the club by the
OL,20,Fcouncil for football, but also for use
OL,21,Fby the public as a park.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
