OL,3,GNEWSAResidents oppose football club's
OL,4,Apublic field fence
OL,5,
OL,6,FSkelton East's Conservative councillor
OL,7,FJustin Thompson said it was "a step too
OL,8,Ffar" and the community was increasingly
OL,9,Ffrustrated. The club said plans would
OL,10,Fstrike a balance between maintaining
OL,11,Fpublic use and protecting its
OL,12,Ffacilities.
